<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: This angora rabbit has bonded with a colonist. It will provide a psychic connection to that colonist increasing psychic entropy recovery rate, but the rabbit will die if the bonded colonist dies.-->
  <VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBonded.description>这只安哥拉猫兔子与殖民者结下了不解之缘。它将提供与该殖民者的精神联系，从而增加精神熵恢复率，但如果被束缚的殖民者死亡，兔子也会死亡。</VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBonded.description>
  <!--EN: angora rabbit bonded-->
  <VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBonded.label>安哥拉 兔子 保税</VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBonded.label>
  <!--EN: Psychic connection with an angora rabbit that helps with neural heat dissipation.-->
  <VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBondedPawn.description>与安哥拉猫兔子的心灵联系，有助于神经散热。</VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBondedPawn.description>
  <!--EN: angora bond-->
  <VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBondedPawn.label>安哥拉债券</VAERoy_AngoraRabbitBondedPawn.label>
  <!--EN: Psychically-induced invisibility. This actually affects others nearby, making their brains unable to perceive the sight of this individual, even if the eyes are unaffected.-->
  <VAERoy_PsychicInvisibility.description>精神诱导的隐形。这实际上会影响附近的其他人，使他们的大脑无法感知这个人的视线，即使眼睛不受影响。</VAERoy_PsychicInvisibility.description>
  <!--EN: psychic invisibility-->
  <VAERoy_PsychicInvisibility.label>心灵隐形</VAERoy_PsychicInvisibility.label>
  <!--EN: The royal peacock nuzzled me. I can feel a psychic energy flowing through my body.-->
  <VAERoy_PsychicSensitivity.description>皇家孔雀用鼻子蹭我。我能感觉到一股心灵能量流过我的身体。</VAERoy_PsychicSensitivity.description>
  <!--EN: nuzzled by a peacock-->
  <VAERoy_PsychicSensitivity.label>被孔雀用鼻子蹭着</VAERoy_PsychicSensitivity.label>
